<title>MEXICO: Grupo Carso 9-mos net falls.</title>
<headline>Grupo Carso 9-mos net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p>	Net		   2.38 bln		 2.81 bln</p>
<p>	Revs		 16.84 bln		15.67 bln</p>
<p>	Gross profit	5.83 bln		 5.39 bln</p>
<p>	Oper income	 3.59 bln		 3.18 bln</p>
<p>	Int fin     gain 12.07 million  cost	 1.30 bln</p>
<p>	  Int paid	 2.14  bln		     N.A.</p>
<p>	  Int earned     279.1 million		     N.A.</p>
<p>	  Mon	gain   1.50 bln		     N.A.</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Carso, S.A.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289500</p>
